  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;FRANTIŠEK FIEDLER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"František Fiedler is a Czech economist and lawyer known for his advocacy of Czech rights and his work in the Abgeordnetenhaus, and now a member of the Australian House of Representatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"František Fiedler is a person with a unique blend of European and Australian perspectives, expected to bring a fresh voice to the country's policy debates."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRO-HUNGARIAN EMPIRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Austro-Hungarian Empire is a historical context where František Fiedler lived and worked, characterized by cultural, linguistic, and national diversity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ABGEORDNETENHAUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Abgeordnetenhaus is the House of Representatives of the former Austrian Imperial Council, where František Fiedler served as a Member."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRALIAN HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Australian House of Representatives is the legislative body where František Fiedler is now a member, bringing his expertise in economics and international relations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Australian House of Representatives is a part of the legislative branch of the Australian government."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CZECH REPUBLIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Czech Republic is František Fiedler's home country, where he has served in various capacities including the Czech Council."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CANBERRA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Canberra is the capital city of Australia where the Australian House of Representatives is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCOTT MORRISON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Scott Morrison is the current Prime Minister of Australia, praising František Fiedler's appointment to the House of Representatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MALCOLM TURNBULL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Malcolm Turnbull is a former Prime Minister of Australia, mentioned as having connections with František Fiedler."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EUROPEAN UNION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"European Union is the focus of František Fiedler's expected speech in the Australian House of Representatives, emphasizing economic cooperation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The European Union is a political and economic union of multiple countries, emphasizing economic cooperation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CZECH COUNCIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Czech Council is the body where František Fiedler served before joining the Abgeordnetenhaus, known for his advocacy of Czech rights."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CANBERRA, AUSTRALIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Canberra, Australia is the capital city where the Australian House of Representatives is located, and where František Fiedler now serves."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Austria is part of the historical context of the Austro-Hungarian Empire, where František Fiedler initially worked."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BOHEMIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bohemia is a region within the Austro-Hungarian Empire where the Badeni Language Ordinance was passed, recognizing Czech as an official language."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BADENI LANGUAGE ORDINANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Badeni Language Ordinance is a landmark legislation passed in 1897, recognizing Czech as an official language in Bohemia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FREE TRADE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Free Trade is an area of expertise for František Fiedler, mentioned as part of his resume and his advocacy for economic cooperation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ECONOMIC COOPERATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Economic Cooperation is the focus of František Fiedler's expected speech in the Australian House of Representatives, emphasizing international economic relations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL TRADE AGREEMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"International Trade Agreements are areas where František Fiedler has worked, facilitating his connections with Australian policymakers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CZECH RIGHTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Czech Rights are a significant part of František Fiedler's advocacy, including language rights and cultural autonomy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LANGUAGE RIGHTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Language Rights are a key aspect of František Fiedler's advocacy, particularly in the context of the Badeni Language Ordinance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CULTURAL AUTONOMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cultural Autonomy is another area of František Fiedler's advocacy, aiming to protect and promote Czech culture within the empire."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINANCIAL WOES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Financial Woes are the issues František Fiedler addressed with his expertise in economics, helping to craft innovative solutions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TUMULTUOUS WATERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tumultuous Waters metaphorically describe the challenging political environment in the Austro-Hungarian Empire during the time of František Fiedler."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONALISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nationalism is a significant theme in the context of the Austro-Hungarian Empire, influencing the political landscape and František Fiedler's advocacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REPRESENTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Representation is a core value for František Fiedler, both in his advocacy and in his work in the Abgeordnetenhaus and the Australian House of Representatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JUSTICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Justice is a fundamental principle that drives František Fiedler's work and advocacy throughout his career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EQUALITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Equality is another important value for František Fiedler, reflected in his efforts to promote Czech rights and cultural autonomy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONSTITUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Constitution is the legal document that allows for the appointment of international experts to the Australian House of Representatives in exceptional circumstances."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INVESTIGATIVE TEAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Investigative Team is the group that uncovered the details of František Fiedler's connections with Australian policymakers and his appointment to the House of Representatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRALIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
